# Conn, Gould and Toint, Chapter 2: Basic Concepts

Chapter 2 of [conn2000trust] collects the matrix theory that the later chapters use. Section 2.2
treats eigenpairs, the spectral decomposition of a symmetric matrix, the singular value
decomposition and eigenvalue bounds such as the Gershgorin discs. Section 2.3 treats vector norms
and their dual norms, the energy norm $\|x\|_H = \sqrt{x^T H x}$ of a symmetric positive definite
matrix $H$, and the matrix norms induced by vector norms.

